  "instruction": "Enforce the quiet-cleaning rules using `/tmp/cleaning/map.png` and `/home/user/cleaning/quiet.html`. Resolve the current and future bedroom cleaning conflicts in SmartHome, record each outcome and the current vacuum battery level in the form, then submit the page.",
